                                   "title":  "Letterboxd review of Summer",
                                   "snippet":  "[Letterboxd Review of \"Summer\"] SUMMER (1930)\"The bugs of summer frolic and dance.\"Second entry in Walt Disney\u0027s Silly Symphonies Seasonal Cycle!In comparison with Springtime (1929), I found Summer\u0027s lack of narrative even more bland. The animated visuals are gorgeous and the musical score is merry, but I was hoping Summer would have more Summertime vibes abounding. Summer makes me think of BBQ\u0027s and beaches, not multiple bugs devouring one another.Here\u0027s to Autumn (1930) and Winter (1930)! 🍻",
                                   "link":  "https://letterboxd.com/film/summer/"
