                               {
                                   "title":  "Letterboxd review of Summer",
                                   "snippet":  "[Letterboxd Review of \"Summer\"] I find these early Silly Symphonies super charming, and as adorable as Summer is, it does feel a little less inspired than some other entries in the series. It\u0027s not that I don\u0027t love the formula of picking a theme and building a plotless little cartoon revue out of it -- because I absolutely do -- but, I don\u0027t know, they didn\u0027t quite nail this one like they usually do. Still adorable, but the bar is high!",
